    ('颧骨与面部轮廓', 'Cheekbones and facial contour', '结合颧骨高低和面部转折，讨论眉峰、眉尾与脸部轮廓的视觉关系。', 'Consider cheekbone prominence and facial contours when placing the arch and tail.'),
