    ('恢复期和留色时间能保证吗？', 'Can recovery time or pigment retention be guaranteed?', '不能。恢复表现和留色时间受个人肤质、原有底色、操作及护理等因素影响。门店提供的时间是经验参考，具体以本人恢复情况和到店评估为准。', 'No. Skin, existing pigment, the procedure and aftercare can affect healing and retention. Any time estimate is an experience-based guide, not a guaranteed result.'),
